"┌─[1]─Status───┌ Keybindings ─ Main ────────────────────────────┐──────────────┐"
"│◐ dev → adb-1.│  j/↓  next run, or scroll a line               │ion  Result   │"
"│3 of 3 jobs · │  k/↑  previous run, or scroll a line           │     ◐ RUNNING│"
"│◐ 1 · ✗ 1 · ● │   ^D  ten runs or lines down                   │     ✓ SUCCESS│"
"└──────────────│   ^U  ten runs or lines up                     │     ✗ FAILED │"
"┌─[2]─Jobs by a│Enter  open the run: tasks and message          │              │"
"│ 2h ◐ [someone│l/]/→  next tab                                 │              │"
"│ 1d ✗ nightly_│h/[/←  previous tab                             │              │"
"│    · weekly_r│  Esc  back: close the run, then the panel      │              │"
"│              │    x  actions menu                             │              │"
"│              │    r  refresh runs                             │              │"
"│              │    o  open job in browser                      │              │"
"│              │    y  copy job URL                             │              │"
"└──────────────│    Y  copy the runs table as text              │              │"
"┌─[3]─Pipelines│  0-4  focus panel by number                    │              │"
"│              │  Tab  next side panel                          │──────────────┘"
"│              │    R  refresh everything                       │──────────────┐"
"│              │    +  cycle screen mode                        │   200    84ms│"
"└──────────────│    @  toggle the API log                       │&… 200   131ms│"
"┌─[4]─Compute ⠋│    A  enable or disable actions this session   │              │"
"│              │    p  switch profile: any in ~/.databrickscfg  │              │"
"│              │    ?  this list                                │              │"
"└──────────────│ q/^C  quit                                     │──────────────┘"
" Scroll: j/k │ └───────────────────Esc: close───────────────────┘         v0.1.0"
